		<div id="PresetName" class="jucePos juceTextButton txt3" style="left: 157dp; top: 417dp; width: 237dp;">OvertureCK</div>
		<div id="PresetPrev" class="jucePos juceTextButton txt4" style="left: 454dp; top: 415dp; width: 36dp; height: 30dp; line-height: 30dp;">&lt;</div>
		<div id="PresetNext" class="jucePos juceTextButton txt4" style="left: 492dp; top: 415dp; width: 36dp; height: 30dp; line-height: 30dp;">&gt;</div>
